  m_text: "<Number Key Assignments>\n[1] : Open / Close this box\n[2] : Transition
    to Title scene\n[3] : Transition to Link scene\n[4] : Transition to Stage1 scene*\n[5]
    : Transition to Stage2 scene*\n[6] : Transition to Stage3 scene*\n[7] : Transition
    to Result scene\n[8] : Reload current scene\n[9] : ---\n[0] : ---\n\n *To transition
    to Stage01~03 scenes, \n   you must go through the Link scene and connect the
    controller."
